===========================================================
WORKER JUDGEMENT CALLS
===========================================================
1. bigticket dict re-scope — REJECTED, see criterion 7 above. The
   component itself is fine: TestRenderBigTicketCard_ShowsCalendarMonth
   asserts `aria-label="Delete big ticket New Car"` survives and the
   component renders (my own probe of "whatif-bigticket-card" with an
   unparseable StartDate rendered Name/Amount/delete button correctly).
   The defect is the SECOND, unupdated call site in pages/whatif.html.
2. Empty calendar label — CONFIRMED. Probe with StartDate="not-a-date":
   whatif-onetime-card and whatif-bigticket-card both render NO
   `<span></span>` and no empty text div (both checks false); the
   `{{if $when}}` guards elide the element entirely.
3. UpdateExpenseSource endYear=&0 -> EndMonth=&0 — CONFIRMED AS
   IMPLEMENTED AND SPEC-CONFORMANT; behaviour change is real but benign.
   Reachability probe (real handler, PUT /whatif/expense/e1):
     end_year=0 status=200 StartMonth=0 EndMonth=&0 active(m0)=false amount(m0)=0
   `parseYearRange` (handlers_income_expense.go:43-54) only accepts a
   non-blank end_year, rejects ey<0, and rejects `ey < startYear` — so
   end_year=0 is submittable ONLY together with start_year=0, and the
   result is an expense that contributes 0 forever. Old behaviour was
   "perpetual". Two reasons this is not a FAIL: (a) criterion 7 pins
   `EndMonth = endYear*12 (nil stays nil)` literally, which is what was
   written; (b) the input's own tooltip already says
   `title="Year expense ends (blank = never, 0 = ends immediately)"`
   (expense-sources-list.html:39) — the NEW behaviour matches the
   documented affordance and the OLD one contradicted it. Logged as an
   observation for RC3's relabelling.
4. Validator tests inverted — CONFIRMED, see criterion 6.
5. budget_fit scheduleNote — CONFIRMED, see criterion 5; rendered string
   "ends Apr 2034" observed in the equivalence dump and the label branch
   is mutation-killed.
6. Inline edit inputs keep `div .StartMonth 12` — CONFIRMED, loud not
   silent. Rendered values probe (whatif-expense-sources-list):
     StartMonth 24 / EndMonth 60 -> value="2" , value="5"
     StartMonth 11 / EndMonth 71 -> value="0.9166666666666666" , value="5.916666666666667"
     StartMonth 0  / EndMonth &0 -> value="0" , value="0"
   Re-save probe through the REAL handler handleWhatIfUpdateExpense:
     FLOAT re-save  status=400  (error partial body)
     ALIGNED re-save status=200 StartMonth=24 EndMonth=60   <- unchanged round trip
   The 400 genuinely happens (parseFormInt -> strconv.Atoi) and the
   year-aligned round trip is byte-for-byte unchanged.
7. UserSettings.ExpenseSources inherits UnmarshalJSON — CONFIRMED (the
   type is models.UserSettings in user_profile.go:9, there is no
   `UserProfile` type). Probe:
     LEGACY UserSettings: n=1 StartMonth=24 EndMonth=48
   from `{"expense_sources":[{...,"start_year":2,"end_year":4}]}`.
8. gofmt — CONFIRMED, see criterion 9.

